(4368354, 629825, 60862, '<td valign="top">I like the concept and the composition.  The image needs a little more contrast, though.  The snow is pretty gray - see how it almost matches the gray background for DPC''s Web pages?  Try setting exposure compensation to +1 when shooting bright backgrounds like snow or sand.</td>', 'I like the concept and the composition.  The image needs a little more contrast, though.  The snow is pretty gray - see how it almost matches the gray background for DPC''s Web pages?  Try setting exposure compensation to +1 when shooting bright backgrounds like snow or sand.', '2008-01-07 01:00:30.000000', NULL, 1),
