(4368367, 628788, 60862, '<td valign="top">Ah, a full day time lapse?  That''s the sun on left and right?  Nice!  The sky is gorgeous, of course, but the small vertical size leaves me missing a lot of the impact.</td>', 'Ah, a full day time lapse?  That''s the sun on left and right?  Nice!  The sky is gorgeous, of course, but the small vertical size leaves me missing a lot of the impact.', '2008-01-07 01:06:04.000000', NULL, 1),
