(4369143, 629131, 84438, '<td valign="top">A single frame of this would make for a beautiful photo.  The time lapse aspect almost takes away from the simplicity of it.  <br/> <br/>In my opinion, too many of the photos in this challenge are unappealing by themselves, and are made to look even more unappealing with time lapse.  This is fantastic.<br/> <br/>This deserves a ribbon for sure.</td>', 'A single frame of this would make for a beautiful photo.  The time lapse aspect almost takes away from the simplicity of it.   In my opinion, too many of the photos in this challenge are unappealing by themselves, and are made to look even more unappealing with time lapse.  This is fantastic. This deserves a ribbon for sure.', '2008-01-07 09:32:33.000000', NULL, 1),
