(4369387, 629757, 85886, '<td valign="top">One of my favourites from this challenge (if it stays legal!) but a wicked photo nonetheless.  The perspective is gorgeous and I love the black and white which suits the toning perfectly, dark heavy jumbo against soft white clouds.  For the sake of criticism/improvement, it would be nice to have removed the top of that lamppost from the sign if it was physically possible and for the last couple of jumbo frames to have been separated...but I''m guessing you were on a fixed time lapse, so the togetherness of the planes is the plane slowing down for a landing.  Ace pic - solid 9 and a fave.</td>', 'One of my favourites from this challenge (if it stays legal!) but a wicked photo nonetheless.  The perspective is gorgeous and I love the black and white which suits the toning perfectly, dark heavy jumbo against soft white clouds.  For the sake of criticism/improvement, it would be nice to have removed the top of that lamppost from the sign if it was physically possible and for the last couple of jumbo frames to have been separated...but I''m guessing you were on a fixed time lapse, so the togetherness of the planes is the plane slowing down for a landing.  Ace pic - solid 9 and a fave.', '2008-01-07 10:31:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4369388, 629740, 88336, '<td valign="top">National Geographic...here you come.  Nice work.</td>', 'National Geographic...here you come.  Nice work.', '2008-01-07 10:32:04.000000', NULL, 1),
