(4369405, 629754, 61961, '<td valign="top">Fits the theme well.  The doggy looks a bit scared (or is that excitement?). :-)</td>', 'Fits the theme well.  The doggy looks a bit scared (or is that excitement?). :-)', '2008-01-07 10:35:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4369408, 629557, 85886, '<td valign="top">Amazing shot, not only for the obviously interesting/thrilling action but also for the lighting which for me is the really impressive part.  With such deft lighting skills I''d be tempted to shout "Larus" but I''m way too new around here to be starting to guess (and there''s no snow!).  The lighting on the subjects face in the three frames you can see it is amazing.  The exposure for the most part is well handled with so much DoF and crazy shadowing - and I can see why you''ve underexposed to accentuate the rider.  Is there any tone mapping in the foreground?  Is that a speedlte behind the mound?  Teach me your skills!!  Anyhow..congrats on a brilliant photo.</td>', 'Amazing shot, not only for the obviously interesting/thrilling action but also for the lighting which for me is the really impressive part.  With such deft lighting skills I''d be tempted to shout "Larus" but I''m way too new around here to be starting to guess (and there''s no snow!).  The lighting on the subjects face in the three frames you can see it is amazing.  The exposure for the most part is well handled with so much DoF and crazy shadowing - and I can see why you''ve underexposed to accentuate the rider.  Is there any tone mapping in the foreground?  Is that a speedlte behind the mound?  Teach me your skills!!  Anyhow..congrats on a brilliant photo.', '2008-01-07 10:35:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4369412, 629850, 61961, '<td valign="top">Tricky!  Took me a second to see it and then I was startled!  Good job.</td>', 'Tricky!  Took me a second to see it and then I was startled!  Good job.', '2008-01-07 10:37:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4369415, 629756, 85886, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot - the large amount of clear sky provides a lovely backdrop to these iconic buildings and moves the focus to them and away from the sky (often the sky overpowers if it''s too interesting with stars).  For me I''d like to see the buildings with a little more definition, maybe reduce the highlights or up the shadows as they feel just a tad overexposed...but it''s a beatiful shot as is.</td>', 'Very nice shot - the large amount of clear sky provides a lovely backdrop to these iconic buildings and moves the focus to them and away from the sky (often the sky overpowers if it''s too interesting with stars).  For me I''d like to see the buildings with a little more definition, maybe reduce the highlights or up the shadows as they feel just a tad overexposed...but it''s a beatiful shot as is.', '2008-01-07 10:38:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4369417, 628021, 88336, '<td valign="top">The it took me longer than it should have to identify that the paper boat was the object of the picture.  Next time find a object that leaves no doubt.</td>', 'The it took me longer than it should have to identify that the paper boat was the object of the picture.  Next time find a object that leaves no doubt.', '2008-01-07 10:38:46.000000', NULL, 1),
