(4369446, 629131, 85886, '<td valign="top">This is such a gorgeous shot.  I love the late afternoon colours and the incredible DoF you''ve kept - the shot without the children would have been fantastic on its own - but adding the children and the simple movement is lovely.  I like that it''s a simple movement of a silver ball on this canvas because for me it really gives it a magical feel (oh yes, double rainbow too!).  For some reason my brain says ''moonscape''...no idea why.  No idea if this stays legal but whatever happens it''s a winner :)</td>', 'This is such a gorgeous shot.  I love the late afternoon colours and the incredible DoF you''ve kept - the shot without the children would have been fantastic on its own - but adding the children and the simple movement is lovely.  I like that it''s a simple movement of a silver ball on this canvas because for me it really gives it a magical feel (oh yes, double rainbow too!).  For some reason my brain says ''moonscape''...no idea why.  No idea if this stays legal but whatever happens it''s a winner :)', '2008-01-07 10:45:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4369448, 629708, 14614, '<td valign="top">inventive - like the fish eye effect - background building takes away from overall composition.  I know it couldn''t be avoided given your vantage point but the white roof pulls my eye to an uninteresting spot. As presented one of my ribbon picks</td>', 'inventive - like the fish eye effect - background building takes away from overall composition.  I know it couldn''t be avoided given your vantage point but the white roof pulls my eye to an uninteresting spot. As presented one of my ribbon picks', '2008-01-07 10:45:20.000000', NULL, 1),
