(4369494, 629318, 72318, '<td valign="top">Another one in which it has to be one image... show me a camera which can take these extremely quick images in succession and i''ll say this cant be DQ''d on the basis that it is either non-sequential images put together, or one image using strobing (which according to the details is not time-lapse as it specifies "one image").  Just making a point here that i hope will be ironed out in future.  Nice image anyway.</td>', 'Another one in which it has to be one image... show me a camera which can take these extremely quick images in succession and i''ll say this cant be DQ''d on the basis that it is either non-sequential images put together, or one image using strobing (which according to the details is not time-lapse as it specifies "one image").  Just making a point here that i hope will be ironed out in future.  Nice image anyway.', '2008-01-07 10:59:58.000000', NULL, 1),
