(4369574, 629448, 63267, '<td valign="top">I have to commend you for going outside of the box on this one.  Well, in my opinion you have gone outside fo the box.  You have taken a challenge that many of us expect to see one thing and given us a completely differetn interpretation of it.  Unfortunately, I can only image the amount of DNMC comments that precede my comment.<br/> <br/>As far as the image itself goes, I think that the vast amount of white negative space is a distractor to the image.  While others may think it is genious, I find it to be overdone.<br/> <br/>I like your idea and the fact that you took the risk in doing this, I just wish it was done a little differently.  Still I am giving you a 6 for it.</td>', 'I have to commend you for going outside of the box on this one.  Well, in my opinion you have gone outside fo the box.  You have taken a challenge that many of us expect to see one thing and given us a completely differetn interpretation of it.  Unfortunately, I can only image the amount of DNMC comments that precede my comment. As far as the image itself goes, I think that the vast amount of white negative space is a distractor to the image.  While others may think it is genious, I find it to be overdone. I like your idea and the fact that you took the risk in doing this, I just wish it was done a little differently.  Still I am giving you a 6 for it.', '2008-01-07 11:28:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4369580, 629941, 63267, '<td valign="top">I think you have a neat photo here.  I like the composition.  My only quip is on technique.  The bug on the ledt is quite a bit darker than the others.  Is that because the light is falling off towards the intersection of the window frames, or because of different exposures in the frames.  I am not at liberty to see the Exif, so I can''t tell.  I also see some haloing around a couplf the bugs that I assume is from the blending of the images.<br/> <br/>Overall I really do liek the photos, especially the comp, but I don''t think it is the strongest in the challenge, so I am giving it a 7.</td>', 'I think you have a neat photo here.  I like the composition.  My only quip is on technique.  The bug on the ledt is quite a bit darker than the others.  Is that because the light is falling off towards the intersection of the window frames, or because of different exposures in the frames.  I am not at liberty to see the Exif, so I can''t tell.  I also see some haloing around a couplf the bugs that I assume is from the blending of the images. Overall I really do liek the photos, especially the comp, but I don''t think it is the strongest in the challenge, so I am giving it a 7.', '2008-01-07 11:30:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4369582, 629754, 59029, '<td valign="top">love the fun here in this shot, 10</td>', 'love the fun here in this shot, 10', '2008-01-07 11:31:20.000000', NULL, 1),
