(4369599, 629946, 63267, '<td valign="top">You have an image that I expected to see a lot of in this challenge.  Aside from the outfit that the skater is wearing, I don''t see much that sets yours apart form the others.  The blending is good for the most part but there is some halo effect around some of the skaters.<br/> <br/>I think you blended a couple too many skaters in this shot and would have liked it better if you had done every other skater as opposed to every one.  Still you got the technique down and I think that a 7 is a fair vote.</td>', 'You have an image that I expected to see a lot of in this challenge.  Aside from the outfit that the skater is wearing, I don''t see much that sets yours apart form the others.  The blending is good for the most part but there is some halo effect around some of the skaters. I think you blended a couple too many skaters in this shot and would have liked it better if you had done every other skater as opposed to every one.  Still you got the technique down and I think that a 7 is a fair vote.', '2008-01-07 11:34:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4369607, 628021, 63267, '<td valign="top">I really hope that this image is not overlooked by most of the voters on DPC.  I think you have done somethign wonderful here.  The idea of a newspaper boat floating down a stream is just awesome.  I could have never thought of something like that.  I love the processing.  I like the mood that it presents as almost a magical little stream where adults drema about their childhood.<br/> <br/>Top shelf image here that is worht nothign short of a 10.  I hope to see it on the front page and hope the other voters don''t look past it to put it there.</td>', 'I really hope that this image is not overlooked by most of the voters on DPC.  I think you have done somethign wonderful here.  The idea of a newspaper boat floating down a stream is just awesome.  I could have never thought of something like that.  I love the processing.  I like the mood that it presents as almost a magical little stream where adults drema about their childhood. Top shelf image here that is worht nothign short of a 10.  I hope to see it on the front page and hope the other voters don''t look past it to put it there.', '2008-01-07 11:36:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4369608, 629494, 66384, '<td valign="top">I''d prefer this shot without the carnation. It''s a lovely and sad progression. Good job on combining the images. Sad the rose never fully opened.</td>', 'I''d prefer this shot without the carnation. It''s a lovely and sad progression. Good job on combining the images. Sad the rose never fully opened.', '2008-01-07 11:36:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4369618, 629486, 63267, '<td valign="top">I see the time lapse here, but I don''t see it as a fluid motion like all of the discussion was about.  I think you have a great idea here, I am just not sure it met the intention.  I will not vote based on intention though, and instead will focus on the image because that is the fair thing to do.<br/> <br/>Again, I like the idea.  I think the colors could have been a little better though, especially contrtasted against the white.  It looks like some flash residue is on some of the cubes and that washed the color out.  I think a boost in contrast would probably fix the color problem that I see.<br/> <br/>Overall I like what you have done, and intent aside, will give you a 6.  Stronger colors would have gotten a 7.</td>', 'I see the time lapse here, but I don''t see it as a fluid motion like all of the discussion was about.  I think you have a great idea here, I am just not sure it met the intention.  I will not vote based on intention though, and instead will focus on the image because that is the fair thing to do. Again, I like the idea.  I think the colors could have been a little better though, especially contrtasted against the white.  It looks like some flash residue is on some of the cubes and that washed the color out.  I think a boost in contrast would probably fix the color problem that I see. Overall I like what you have done, and intent aside, will give you a 6.  Stronger colors would have gotten a 7.', '2008-01-07 11:40:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4369624, 628429, 63267, '<td valign="top">I will give your title some credit.<br/> <br/>I don''t like the three frames here, and I remember that being a specific question that was asked in the rules announcement thread.  For that I am dissapointed to see it in the image.<br/> <br/>I will not vote on that though, as that is for the SC to determine.<br/> <br/>As far as the image goes, I think you needed to show the shoe horn in the first frame.  I am not really seeing a lot about this image that makes it pop.  I am going to have to give it a 5.</td>', 'I will give your title some credit. I don''t like the three frames here, and I remember that being a specific question that was asked in the rules announcement thread.  For that I am dissapointed to see it in the image. I will not vote on that though, as that is for the SC to determine. As far as the image goes, I think you needed to show the shoe horn in the first frame.  I am not really seeing a lot about this image that makes it pop.  I am going to have to give it a 5.', '2008-01-07 11:42:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4369628, 629226, 63267, '<td valign="top">I like the title and the composition.  Overall I think that you met the challenge very well.  Blending looks good.  But the image looks a little soft, and the birds maybe a bit OOF.  For that I am giving it a 6.</td>', 'I like the title and the composition.  Overall I think that you met the challenge very well.  Blending looks good.  But the image looks a little soft, and the birds maybe a bit OOF.  For that I am giving it a 6.', '2008-01-07 11:43:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4369636, 629523, 63267, '<td valign="top">Great action sequence here.  You really nailed the challenge.  Exposure is good.  At first I didn''t like the washed out sky, but then I saw how the red shirt contrasts against it and didn''t mind it near as bad.  Overall I great image that meets the challenge and deserves an 8.</td>', 'Great action sequence here.  You really nailed the challenge.  Exposure is good.  At first I didn''t like the washed out sky, but then I saw how the red shirt contrasts against it and didn''t mind it near as bad.  Overall I great image that meets the challenge and deserves an 8.', '2008-01-07 11:46:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4369639, 629186, 63267, '<td valign="top">Swee.t I really like your take on the challenge.  Only quip would be the noise on the left of the curled match, but I am sure in blending that this is tough to get rid of.  I like that you chose a unique subject and made it work.  Well done.  9.</td>', 'Swee.t I really like your take on the challenge.  Only quip would be the noise on the left of the curled match, but I am sure in blending that this is tough to get rid of.  I like that you chose a unique subject and made it work.  Well done.  9.', '2008-01-07 11:47:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4369646, 629553, 40718, '<td valign="top">Hi roba.  I think you have me beat with this shot. ;)</td>', 'Hi roba.  I think you have me beat with this shot. ;)', '2008-01-07 11:49:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4369649, 629823, 85886, '<td valign="top">Maybe it''s the letterboxing but this has such a movie feel to it.  The umbrella works brilliantly against the drab rainy surround.</td>', 'Maybe it''s the letterboxing but this has such a movie feel to it.  The umbrella works brilliantly against the drab rainy surround.', '2008-01-07 11:50:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4369652, 629687, 63267, '<td valign="top">This is a tough one to see.  The second hand is very tough to make out.  The first time I looked at the image I couldn''t see it, or its motion.  Perhaps a bit stronger presence would prevent that missed look.<br/> <br/>I like the concept, I like what you have done.  I just wish that the second hand stood out more.  An extra point for being outside of the box, and for being creative on an image.  7</td>', 'This is a tough one to see.  The second hand is very tough to make out.  The first time I looked at the image I couldn''t see it, or its motion.  Perhaps a bit stronger presence would prevent that missed look. I like the concept, I like what you have done.  I just wish that the second hand stood out more.  An extra point for being outside of the box, and for being creative on an image.  7', '2008-01-07 11:51:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4369658, 628989, 66384, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image. Love the colors.</td>', 'Beautiful image. Love the colors.', '2008-01-07 11:52:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4369660, 629287, 85886, '<td valign="top">I love the anticipation you''ve captured in his eyes.  The perspective and framing is all brilliant.  The leading space really lends itself to the incoming ball and leading the eye through this time lapse.  Well done!</td>', 'I love the anticipation you''ve captured in his eyes.  The perspective and framing is all brilliant.  The leading space really lends itself to the incoming ball and leading the eye through this time lapse.  Well done!', '2008-01-07 11:52:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4369666, 629741, 63267, '<td valign="top">You have a great entry here.  I am not too sure that anyone else has a large ship in their picture as the main subject.  The processing fits the image well and you definately met the challenge.  But I don''t find it overly exciting.  Because of that I am going to give it a 6.</td>', 'You have a great entry here.  I am not too sure that anyone else has a large ship in their picture as the main subject.  The processing fits the image well and you definately met the challenge.  But I don''t find it overly exciting.  Because of that I am going to give it a 6.', '2008-01-07 11:54:12.000000', NULL, 1),
