(4369674, 629339, 85886, '<td valign="top">I don''t know how other people feel but this one I find kind of scary.  It''s a lovely idea but to me looks like a three headed lion.</td>', 'I don''t know how other people feel but this one I find kind of scary.  It''s a lovely idea but to me looks like a three headed lion.', '2008-01-07 11:57:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4369682, 629942, 63267, '<td valign="top">The title here really matches the expression on the woman''s face.  Only fault I see is the belnding gets a little muddy around the back two frames.  6.</td>', 'The title here really matches the expression on the woman''s face.  Only fault I see is the belnding gets a little muddy around the back two frames.  6.', '2008-01-07 11:59:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4369686, 629553, 63267, '<td valign="top">This had to have been a pain to do.  You did a great job blendind all of those frames to show the full swing.  My only complaint in the photo sis the ball.  What happened to the ball?  I looks like a partial moon.  Still a great job and worth a 9.</td>', 'This had to have been a pain to do.  You did a great job blendind all of those frames to show the full swing.  My only complaint in the photo sis the ball.  What happened to the ball?  I looks like a partial moon.  Still a great job and worth a 9.', '2008-01-07 12:00:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4369688, 629425, 63267, '<td valign="top">NEMO!  Great set of shots here.  Wish the motion blue wasn''t as pronouned in the front fish.  I am sure this was challenging, as most aquarium shots are.  7.</td>', 'NEMO!  Great set of shots here.  Wish the motion blue wasn''t as pronouned in the front fish.  I am sure this was challenging, as most aquarium shots are.  7.', '2008-01-07 12:01:46.000000', NULL, 1),
