(4369693, 629630, 63267, '<td valign="top">I like your image, but I am not crazy about the vignette.  It is more of a distraction than an enhancement in my opinion.  Overall you did a nice job blending the image.  Still, that vignetting is a deal breaker for me.  6</td>', 'I like your image, but I am not crazy about the vignette.  It is more of a distraction than an enhancement in my opinion.  Overall you did a nice job blending the image.  Still, that vignetting is a deal breaker for me.  6', '2008-01-07 12:03:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4369697, 629952, 63267, '<td valign="top">Very interesting interpretation of the challenge.  I think you have a great idea, but I think the execution could have been a bit better.  There is too much of a gap between the flame and the burnt out candle.  Still a great idea.  6.</td>', 'Very interesting interpretation of the challenge.  I think you have a great idea, but I think the execution could have been a bit better.  There is too much of a gap between the flame and the burnt out candle.  Still a great idea.  6.', '2008-01-07 12:04:38.000000', NULL, 1),
