(4369799, 629694, 63267, '<td valign="top">Those look like the skis of death.  I don''t know how people ride those without falling all over the place.  To do a 360 as well is nuts.  Nice image, the blending gets a little muddy around some of the guys, but that is ok.  Overall a 6.</td>', 'Those look like the skis of death.  I don''t know how people ride those without falling all over the place.  To do a 360 as well is nuts.  Nice image, the blending gets a little muddy around some of the guys, but that is ok.  Overall a 6.', '2008-01-07 12:20:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4369800, 629852, 63267, '<td valign="top">Very nice action sequence, and I like the perspective.  Well done.  8.</td>', 'Very nice action sequence, and I like the perspective.  Well done.  8.', '2008-01-07 12:21:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4369803, 629741, 66384, '<td valign="top">Nice rich color. Lovely scene.</td>', 'Nice rich color. Lovely scene.', '2008-01-07 12:21:41.000000', NULL, 1),
