(4370606, 629712, 66384, '<td valign="top">Nice motion blur in the center. I like the wood pieces on the wood table. I think a little could be cropped from the top -- I noticed that as I scrolled the image up to make the comment.</td>', 'Nice motion blur in the center. I like the wood pieces on the wood table. I think a little could be cropped from the top -- I noticed that as I scrolled the image up to make the comment.', '2008-01-07 15:33:09.000000', NULL, 1),
