(4371393, 629962, 61818, '<td valign="top">The fireworks don''t look real, something is amiss with the colors.  Maybe that''s a result of overlaying a bunch or not, but 10 shots or 1 - it still needs to be a good looking picture in the end.</td>', 'The fireworks don''t look real, something is amiss with the colors.  Maybe that''s a result of overlaying a bunch or not, but 10 shots or 1 - it still needs to be a good looking picture in the end.', '2008-01-07 19:28:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4371400, 629087, 61818, '<td valign="top">Hah, no arguing about natural motion when all motion is confined to a tiny little globe I guess!  Cool in an abstract sort of way.  Might have cropped off as much of the top of the globe as you did on the bottom to preserve the symmetry that is present throughout the rest of the frame.</td>', 'Hah, no arguing about natural motion when all motion is confined to a tiny little globe I guess!  Cool in an abstract sort of way.  Might have cropped off as much of the top of the globe as you did on the bottom to preserve the symmetry that is present throughout the rest of the frame.', '2008-01-07 19:29:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4371405, 629944, 50695, '<td valign="top">muckpond: oh yeah, rock and roll is natural!<br/> <br/>GeneralE: actually, that looks more like folk music. I think it''s Black is the Color of my True Love''s Hair.<br/> <br/>scalvert: music isn''t natural.<br/> <br/>GeneralE: Pythagoras thought so.<br/> <br/>scalvert: I''m wayyy past Pythagoras. I''m well into the 16th century. And none of Newton''s Laws apply to this. This is a brain moving fingers.<br/> <br/>sher: actually, in order to play properly, something deeper than conscious thought must be at play. Perhaps we can allow that this sort of instinctive motion is indeed natural.<br/> <br/>ursula: it looks like he''s got 11 fingers on one hand. That is NOT natural. <br/> <br/>bucket: you never met my cousin Brunhilde.<br/> <br/>scalvert: how did YOU get in here??</td>', 'muckpond: oh yeah, rock and roll is natural! GeneralE: actually, that looks more like folk music. I think it''s Black is the Color of my True Love''s Hair. scalvert: music isn''t natural. GeneralE: Pythagoras thought so. scalvert: I''m wayyy past Pythagoras. I''m well into the 16th century. And none of Newton''s Laws apply to this. This is a brain moving fingers. sher: actually, in order to play properly, something deeper than conscious thought must be at play. Perhaps we can allow that this sort of instinctive motion is indeed natural. ursula: it looks like he''s got 11 fingers on one hand. That is NOT natural.  bucket: you never met my cousin Brunhilde. scalvert: how did YOU get in here??', '2008-01-07 19:29:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4371412, 629740, 55838, '<td valign="top">Extraordinary capture!  I''m assuming it''s within the rules so I''m back to bump you up to 9.</td>', 'Extraordinary capture!  I''m assuming it''s within the rules so I''m back to bump you up to 9.', '2008-01-07 19:31:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4371418, 629322, 57358, '<td valign="top">Technical looks good, but you may get voted down for your subject.  DPC loves to see emotion, bright colors or very contrast-y type b&amp;w.  I''m wondering if you could have played off of a more drastic angle or something.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Technical looks good, but you may get voted down for your subject.  DPC loves to see emotion, bright colors or very contrast-y type b&w.  I''m wondering if you could have played off of a more drastic angle or something.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2008-01-07 19:31:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4371420, 628989, 55838, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot - lovely colors.  Back to bump you up to 8.</td>', 'Very nice shot - lovely colors.  Back to bump you up to 8.', '2008-01-07 19:32:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4371423, 629287, 50695, '<td valign="top">muckpond: yes! a boy making the play. totally natural.<br/> <br/>GeneralE: I bet he doesn''t even want to be there. Dad is making him do it. Unnatural.<br/> <br/>scalvert: ball is natural. kid is unnatural.<br/> <br/>muckpond: but his eye is on the ball at all times. everything he does is to catch the ball. It''s natural.<br/> <br/>scalvert: he could have caught the ball one-handed. he could have headed the ball first. he had to make a large number of decisions. not natural.<br/> <br/>muckpond: headed the ball? that''s soccer.<br/> <br/>scalvert: most countries call it football.</td>', 'muckpond: yes! a boy making the play. totally natural. GeneralE: I bet he doesn''t even want to be there. Dad is making him do it. Unnatural. scalvert: ball is natural. kid is unnatural. muckpond: but his eye is on the ball at all times. everything he does is to catch the ball. It''s natural. scalvert: he could have caught the ball one-handed. he could have headed the ball first. he had to make a large number of decisions. not natural. muckpond: headed the ball? that''s soccer. scalvert: most countries call it football.', '2008-01-07 19:32:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4371426, 629946, 55838, '<td valign="top">Entertaining shot.  Back to bump you up to 8.</td>', 'Entertaining shot.  Back to bump you up to 8.', '2008-01-07 19:33:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4371428, 629885, 55838, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot.  I love the flow.  Back to bump you up to 9.</td>', 'Beautiful shot.  I love the flow.  Back to bump you up to 9.', '2008-01-07 19:33:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4371437, 629425, 57358, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  I love it.  This very well may get top 20.  I think that you may have done better if your colors were brighter; if the orange stood out more from the coral.  (my monitor is calibrated).  Other than that, I love the idea and the composition.  It must have took forever to get a shot of this guy, especially through glass.</td>', 'Beautiful.  I love it.  This very well may get top 20.  I think that you may have done better if your colors were brighter; if the orange stood out more from the coral.  (my monitor is calibrated).  Other than that, I love the idea and the composition.  It must have took forever to get a shot of this guy, especially through glass.', '2008-01-07 19:33:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4371440, 629448, 33672, '<td valign="top">Interesting take on the theme. Clean shot that''s well composed.</td>', 'Interesting take on the theme. Clean shot that''s well composed.', '2008-01-07 19:34:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4371443, 629712, 50695, '<td valign="top">scalvert: falling is Newtonian and natural. I was going to say that the movement of the hand is not natural, but there is no movement of the hand! the hand is only in one exposure.<br/> <br/>GeneralE: yes, but that is motion of a sort. To be not there, and then there, and then not there. That is an Individual Will working in the universe. Not natural.<br/> <br/>scalvert: hmmm you could have a point.<br/> <br/>muckpond: knocking stuff down! totally natural!</td>', 'scalvert: falling is Newtonian and natural. I was going to say that the movement of the hand is not natural, but there is no movement of the hand! the hand is only in one exposure. GeneralE: yes, but that is motion of a sort. To be not there, and then there, and then not there. That is an Individual Will working in the universe. Not natural. scalvert: hmmm you could have a point. muckpond: knocking stuff down! totally natural!', '2008-01-07 19:34:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4371444, 629825, 55838, '<td valign="top">Looks like you had a blast!  Great shot.  Back to bump you up to 8.  Well done.</td>', 'Looks like you had a blast!  Great shot.  Back to bump you up to 8.  Well done.', '2008-01-07 19:34:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4371447, 629186, 55838, '<td valign="top">Clean and simple.  Back to bump you up to 8.</td>', 'Clean and simple.  Back to bump you up to 8.', '2008-01-07 19:34:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4371449, 629087, 33672, '<td valign="top">What a cool idea and executed perfectly. 10 and a fav</td>', 'What a cool idea and executed perfectly. 10 and a fav', '2008-01-07 19:35:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4371455, 629878, 55838, '<td valign="top">Love the editing on this.  Great gold tones and pleasing composition.  Back to bump you up to 8.</td>', 'Love the editing on this.  Great gold tones and pleasing composition.  Back to bump you up to 8.', '2008-01-07 19:35:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4371458, 629406, 57358, '<td valign="top">Technically very good.  I also love the subtle, yet vibrant color.  I can''t really think of anything to improve this, except maybe getting rid of the glare on the balls.</td>', 'Technically very good.  I also love the subtle, yet vibrant color.  I can''t really think of anything to improve this, except maybe getting rid of the glare on the balls.', '2008-01-07 19:36:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4371468, 629467, 57358, '<td valign="top">That''s really cool, and it turned out to be a very interesting photo.</td>', 'That''s really cool, and it turned out to be a very interesting photo.', '2008-01-07 19:36:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4371469, 629751, 50695, '<td valign="top">ursula: this isn''t natural. it''s man-made.<br/> <br/>scalvert: yes but it is a man-made object that acts completely on Newtonian principles. It''s natural.<br/> <br/>GeneralE: yes but it acts in an arbitrary way decided by man. There''s no natural reason why the day has to be divided twice into twelve.<br/> <br/>frisca: so you''re saying that God must be the clockmaker, and not Man?<br/> <br/>GeneralE: um... I think so.</td>', 'ursula: this isn''t natural. it''s man-made. scalvert: yes but it is a man-made object that acts completely on Newtonian principles. It''s natural. GeneralE: yes but it acts in an arbitrary way decided by man. There''s no natural reason why the day has to be divided twice into twelve. frisca: so you''re saying that God must be the clockmaker, and not Man? GeneralE: um... I think so.', '2008-01-07 19:36:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4371473, 628989, 50695, '<td valign="top">scalvert: cross-country skiing isn''t natural enough. It''s gotta be downhill.<br/> <br/>muckpond: no, dude! skiing is totally natural! cold on your face, fighting the elements, adrenaline rush!</td>', 'scalvert: cross-country skiing isn''t natural enough. It''s gotta be downhill. muckpond: no, dude! skiing is totally natural! cold on your face, fighting the elements, adrenaline rush!', '2008-01-07 19:38:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4371481, 629186, 57358, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  It''s hard to get flame shots (at least for me, lol).  I think the only thing I could comment on would be to have this a little sharper... and if I''m really picky to level the bottom match with your horizon line.  Great composition and capture of the idea</td>', 'Very nice.  It''s hard to get flame shots (at least for me, lol).  I think the only thing I could comment on would be to have this a little sharper... and if I''m really picky to level the bottom match with your horizon line.  Great composition and capture of the idea', '2008-01-07 19:38:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4371482, 629501, 55838, '<td valign="top">Not certain I''m "getting" the time lapse here but what a totally cool shot.  Love the editing and the contrast.  Back to bump you up to 8 and adding to favorites.</td>', 'Not certain I''m "getting" the time lapse here but what a totally cool shot.  Love the editing and the contrast.  Back to bump you up to 8 and adding to favorites.', '2008-01-07 19:39:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4371488, 629020, 55838, '<td valign="top">Great colors and lines.  Conveys such a lonely feeling.  Back to bump you up to 8.</td>', 'Great colors and lines.  Conveys such a lonely feeling.  Back to bump you up to 8.', '2008-01-07 19:40:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4371490, 629441, 57358, '<td valign="top">That is neat.  Great idea and composition.  I think the only thing I would do is bump your colors a little if it were possible</td>', 'That is neat.  Great idea and composition.  I think the only thing I would do is bump your colors a little if it were possible', '2008-01-07 19:40:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4371492, 628481, 55838, '<td valign="top">Great colors and subject matter.  Back to bump you up to 8.</td>', 'Great colors and subject matter.  Back to bump you up to 8.', '2008-01-07 19:40:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4371494, 629339, 50695, '<td valign="top">frisca: well this is natural. even if you think that animals think, this animal is in a semi-conscious state. surely this is completely natural motion at this point.<br/> <br/>scalvert: nothing attached to musculature is moving in a "natural" way. too many variables.<br/> <br/>GeneralE: you can''t even tell which way the head is moving. <br/> <br/>ursula: it''s a lion with three heads! not natural!<br/> <br/>sher: that lion is so natural he scares me.</td>', 'frisca: well this is natural. even if you think that animals think, this animal is in a semi-conscious state. surely this is completely natural motion at this point. scalvert: nothing attached to musculature is moving in a "natural" way. too many variables. GeneralE: you can''t even tell which way the head is moving.  ursula: it''s a lion with three heads! not natural! sher: that lion is so natural he scares me.', '2008-01-07 19:41:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4371502, 629757, 57358, '<td valign="top">Nice - I love the moodiness and the sky.  The only thing I could say is that I wish the last plane weren''t overlapping the second one or cut off by the top of the frame - but it''s not like you could sit and reshoot forever.  Everything else is perfect.</td>', 'Nice - I love the moodiness and the sky.  The only thing I could say is that I wish the last plane weren''t overlapping the second one or cut off by the top of the frame - but it''s not like you could sit and reshoot forever.  Everything else is perfect.', '2008-01-07 19:42:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4371511, 628788, 60073, '<td valign="top">Beautiful</td>', 'Beautiful', '2008-01-07 19:44:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4371513, 629952, 57358, '<td valign="top">Very interesting.  Your colors and sharpness look great.  I love how the flame is suspended in the air - looks like more of a mystical shot than passing of time.  I hope you don''t get dinged for that.</td>', 'Very interesting.  Your colors and sharpness look great.  I love how the flame is suspended in the air - looks like more of a mystical shot than passing of time.  I hope you don''t get dinged for that.', '2008-01-07 19:44:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4371514, 628065, 50695, '<td valign="top">scalvert: fireworks are natural. we''ve had them in too many challenges to declare them unnatural now.<br/> <br/>GeneralE: but each firework represents a conscious decision in planning and execution. I am arguing against human intelligence as being natural. I mean just look at the mess we''ve made of this world. And fireworks was the first application of gunpowder. You know where that led us.<br/> <br/>scalvert: yes, but it is physics in action, all lit up and everything!</td>', 'scalvert: fireworks are natural. we''ve had them in too many challenges to declare them unnatural now. GeneralE: but each firework represents a conscious decision in planning and execution. I am arguing against human intelligence as being natural. I mean just look at the mess we''ve made of this world. And fireworks was the first application of gunpowder. You know where that led us. scalvert: yes, but it is physics in action, all lit up and everything!', '2008-01-07 19:44:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4371518, 628806, 57358, '<td valign="top">That''s a great shot.  The only thing I would do is apply a warming filter and straighten the horizon.  Great idea, capture and composition</td>', 'That''s a great shot.  The only thing I would do is apply a warming filter and straighten the horizon.  Great idea, capture and composition', '2008-01-07 19:45:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4371527, 629523, 57358, '<td valign="top">That is cool.  Too bad there wasn''t much in the sky for you.  You might also try boosting your colors (or contrast if it doesn''t wash out his pants) to give this shot a little extra.</td>', 'That is cool.  Too bad there wasn''t much in the sky for you.  You might also try boosting your colors (or contrast if it doesn''t wash out his pants) to give this shot a little extra.', '2008-01-07 19:47:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4371532, 629863, 50695, '<td valign="top">scalvert: the physics of falling and landing. natural.<br/> <br/>GeneralE: splashing is natural.<br/> <br/>ursula: oceans are natural.<br/> <br/>sher: naturally!</td>', 'scalvert: the physics of falling and landing. natural. GeneralE: splashing is natural. ursula: oceans are natural. sher: naturally!', '2008-01-07 19:47:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4371540, 628985, 57358, '<td valign="top">wow - I had to count to make sure you were under your 10 photos, lol.  I love the background - your clouds and colors came out great.  This may be too busy for DPC, but a cool idea</td>', 'wow - I had to count to make sure you were under your 10 photos, lol.  I love the background - your clouds and colors came out great.  This may be too busy for DPC, but a cool idea', '2008-01-07 19:48:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4371547, 628555, 57358, '<td valign="top">That is neat - I just noticed the bird too - that makes it even better.  I think you did great with the colors and the setting</td>', 'That is neat - I just noticed the bird too - that makes it even better.  I think you did great with the colors and the setting', '2008-01-07 19:49:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4371552, 627954, 57358, '<td valign="top">Nice, I love how she''s looking at the camera for the last shot.  The only thing I would do is boost your contrast a tad</td>', 'Nice, I love how she''s looking at the camera for the last shot.  The only thing I would do is boost your contrast a tad', '2008-01-07 19:50:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4371554, 629941, 50695, '<td valign="top">ursula: this is natural unless it''s DrAchoo. there''s nothing natural about shoving a dead ladybug across a window.<br/> <br/>scalvert: <i>refrigerated</i> ladybug.<br/> <br/>ursula: oh, I forgot a DrAchoo fan was here. Well there''s nothing natural with torturing a ladybug across a window, either.<br/> <br/>scalvert: well, it''s not DrAchoo.<br/> <br/>ursula: that''s a relief. I get enough torture on the 6 o''clock news.</td>', 'ursula: this is natural unless it''s DrAchoo. there''s nothing natural about shoving a dead ladybug across a window. scalvert: refrigerated ladybug. ursula: oh, I forgot a DrAchoo fan was here. Well there''s nothing natural with torturing a ladybug across a window, either. scalvert: well, it''s not DrAchoo. ursula: that''s a relief. I get enough torture on the 6 o''clock news.', '2008-01-07 19:50:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4371560, 629740, 57358, '<td valign="top">Oh wow, what a capture.  Beautiful shot, I wonder if there''s any way to bring out the fish a little better, maybe something selective, I wouldn''t know.  It just takes a moment to really tell what you''re looking at.  Everything else is fantastic</td>', 'Oh wow, what a capture.  Beautiful shot, I wonder if there''s any way to bring out the fish a little better, maybe something selective, I wouldn''t know.  It just takes a moment to really tell what you''re looking at.  Everything else is fantastic', '2008-01-07 19:52:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4371564, 629751, 57358, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  I love the angle, the colors and the processing.</td>', 'Beautiful.  I love the angle, the colors and the processing.', '2008-01-07 19:52:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4371566, 629706, 50695, '<td valign="top">muckpond: he sunk the shot! that''s natural!<br/> <br/>GeneralE: I don''t know if that''s a single motion.<br/> <br/>muckpond: UP AND IN! that''s a single motion.<br/> <br/>GeneralE: sounds like two motions to me.<br/> <br/>muckpond: No way, dude. You can''t have in without the up!<br/> <br/>GeneralE: I was always more of a 3-point shooter.</td>', 'muckpond: he sunk the shot! that''s natural! GeneralE: I don''t know if that''s a single motion. muckpond: UP AND IN! that''s a single motion. GeneralE: sounds like two motions to me. muckpond: No way, dude. You can''t have in without the up! GeneralE: I was always more of a 3-point shooter.', '2008-01-07 19:53:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4371568, 629467, 50695, '<td valign="top">scalvert: physics, check.<br/> <br/>GeneralE: one motion, check.<br/> <br/>muckpond: Yo-Yo! Totally natural!</td>', 'scalvert: physics, check. GeneralE: one motion, check. muckpond: Yo-Yo! Totally natural!', '2008-01-07 19:54:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4371574, 627641, 57358, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  You may have done better with a simpler background.  I know that you have a focus on the brick, but with it being so busy and with the runner''s motion blur, it gives the appearance that you don''t have a focus.  Your colors look great, and I love how the hood comes off part way through, it makes the story that much better</td>', 'Very nice.  You may have done better with a simpler background.  I know that you have a focus on the brick, but with it being so busy and with the runner''s motion blur, it gives the appearance that you don''t have a focus.  Your colors look great, and I love how the hood comes off part way through, it makes the story that much better', '2008-01-07 19:55:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4371576, 629523, 50695, '<td valign="top">ursula: that ain''t natural. some little kid like that kicking the crap out of you? that ain''t natural.<br/> <br/>muckpond: that''s totally natural! I saw it on TV!<br/> <br/>scalvert: I''ve got to admit. there''s some pretty cool physics to this.<br/> <br/>GeneralE: yes, and it''s one motion.<br/> <br/>muckpond: and a totally butt-kicking motion, too!</td>', 'ursula: that ain''t natural. some little kid like that kicking the crap out of you? that ain''t natural. muckpond: that''s totally natural! I saw it on TV! scalvert: I''ve got to admit. there''s some pretty cool physics to this. GeneralE: yes, and it''s one motion. muckpond: and a totally butt-kicking motion, too!', '2008-01-07 19:56:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4371581, 629825, 50695, '<td valign="top">scalvert: okay, gravity is natural.<br/> <br/>ursula: but it''s not natural to have four daddies.<br/> <br/>karmat: maybe it is in some cultures.<br/> <br/>ursula: like what culture?<br/> <br/>karmat: I don''t know.</td>', 'scalvert: okay, gravity is natural. ursula: but it''s not natural to have four daddies. karmat: maybe it is in some cultures. ursula: like what culture? karmat: I don''t know.', '2008-01-07 19:57:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4371582, 629961, 57358, '<td valign="top">I''ll be really interested to see what happens with this shot.  Providing it''s not against the rules in any way, DPC will either love it or hate it.  You may want to submit it to the SC for verification just in case so voters don''t knock you down.  Very interesting shot, I would love to know how you did this</td>', 'I''ll be really interested to see what happens with this shot.  Providing it''s not against the rules in any way, DPC will either love it or hate it.  You may want to submit it to the SC for verification just in case so voters don''t knock you down.  Very interesting shot, I would love to know how you did this', '2008-01-07 19:57:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4371587, 629322, 50695, '<td valign="top">GeneralE: if it''s a serve, it''s a single motion and therefore natural. but if it''s a volley, it''s several motions, so it''s not natural.<br/> <br/>muckpond: looks like serve-and-volley to me.<br/> <br/>GeneralE: (brain explodes)</td>', 'GeneralE: if it''s a serve, it''s a single motion and therefore natural. but if it''s a volley, it''s several motions, so it''s not natural. muckpond: looks like serve-and-volley to me. GeneralE: (brain explodes)', '2008-01-07 19:58:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4371592, 629948, 50695, '<td valign="top">sher: okay, now this must be natural. He''s totally at the whim of wind, weather and gravity.<br/> <br/>scalvert: I don''t know, he''s got cords to pull on. It''s a steering device.<br/> <br/>sher: hmm... I don''t remember you being so stringent when we were discussing YOUR picture...<br/> <br/>scalvert: don''t forget my team of experts!</td>', 'sher: okay, now this must be natural. He''s totally at the whim of wind, weather and gravity. scalvert: I don''t know, he''s got cords to pull on. It''s a steering device. sher: hmm... I don''t remember you being so stringent when we were discussing YOUR picture... scalvert: don''t forget my team of experts!', '2008-01-07 20:00:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4371595, 629741, 50695, '<td valign="top">scalvert: well, if we can verify that the pilot took his hand off the wheel and the boat was moving on its own accord, then it''s natural.<br/> <br/>frisca: ok, I''ve got my agents on it right now.<br/> <br/>muckpond: I like boats!</td>', 'scalvert: well, if we can verify that the pilot took his hand off the wheel and the boat was moving on its own accord, then it''s natural. frisca: ok, I''ve got my agents on it right now. muckpond: I like boats!', '2008-01-07 20:02:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4371603, 629708, 57358, '<td valign="top">That is beautiful!</td>', 'That is beautiful!', '2008-01-07 20:04:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4371604, 629318, 50695, '<td valign="top">scalvert: pure physics. that is natural.<br/> <br/>ursula: but it looks like a... thingie...<br/> <br/>scalvert: a what?<br/> <br/>ursula: you know, that thingie that you put on your... thingie.<br/> <br/>scalvert: and how is that relevant?<br/> <br/>ursula: well it''s not natural, not according to the Roman Catholic church.<br/> <br/>scalvert: as an atheist, I approve this photo.</td>', 'scalvert: pure physics. that is natural. ursula: but it looks like a... thingie... scalvert: a what? ursula: you know, that thingie that you put on your... thingie. scalvert: and how is that relevant? ursula: well it''s not natural, not according to the Roman Catholic church. scalvert: as an atheist, I approve this photo.', '2008-01-07 20:05:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4371610, 629501, 43774, '<td valign="top">A lovely photo but I am not sure how it shows time lapse.</td>', 'A lovely photo but I am not sure how it shows time lapse.', '2008-01-07 20:07:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4371617, 629577, 65035, '<td valign="top">Very well done.</td>', 'Very well done.', '2008-01-07 20:10:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4371623, 629131, 1054, '<td valign="top">I like the motion you''ve captured, and the double-rainbow, but I''m afraid the post-processing gives the children almost a CGI look. Still a good shot overall.</td>', 'I like the motion you''ve captured, and the double-rainbow, but I''m afraid the post-processing gives the children almost a CGI look. Still a good shot overall.', '2008-01-07 20:12:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4371627, 629131, 65035, '<td valign="top">Wow you managed to get landscape , seascape, a stunning sky, rainbows, kids and a time lapsed  ball all in one shot! I''m so impressed.</td>', 'Wow you managed to get landscape , seascape, a stunning sky, rainbows, kids and a time lapsed  ball all in one shot! I''m so impressed.', '2008-01-07 20:14:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4371684, 629851, 33446, '<td valign="top">I love the title but not the rustic look of the backboard.<br/> <br/>However, the way that ball gives the basket movement...makes me forget all about the backboard.</td>', 'I love the title but not the rustic look of the backboard. However, the way that ball gives the basket movement...makes me forget all about the backboard.', '2008-01-07 20:30:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4371687, 629284, 77521, '<td valign="top">LOVE THIS 10!!!!</td>', 'LOVE THIS 10!!!!', '2008-01-07 20:31:29.000000', NULL, 1);
