(4372317, 629852, 50695, '<td valign="top">scalvert: look at that. that''s the face of cold deliberation. a confident semi-smirk of accomplishment. that''s not natural.<br/> <br/>muckpond: he nailed it, dude! totally natural!<br/> <br/>karmat: he symbolizes the karmic wave.<br/> <br/>scalvert: wave? I thought it was a circle.<br/> <br/>karmat: if the surfboard is ready, the wave will come.<br/> <br/>scalvert: that''s a skateboard.<br/> <br/>karmat: exactly.<br/> <br/>scalvert: (crosses eyes and slaps forehead)</td>', 'scalvert: look at that. that''s the face of cold deliberation. a confident semi-smirk of accomplishment. that''s not natural. muckpond: he nailed it, dude! totally natural! karmat: he symbolizes the karmic wave. scalvert: wave? I thought it was a circle. karmat: if the surfboard is ready, the wave will come. scalvert: that''s a skateboard. karmat: exactly. scalvert: (crosses eyes and slaps forehead)', '2008-01-07 23:24:20.000000', NULL, 1),
