(4373133, 629851, 88711, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, though the highlights around the ball, backboard and rim are slightly distracting, it still gets me pumped.</td>', 'Beautiful shot, though the highlights around the ball, backboard and rim are slightly distracting, it still gets me pumped.', '2008-01-08 07:07:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4373175, 629744, 63267, '<td valign="top">Nice job of blending the images together.  I think the idea of you looking at yourself is funny.  Good concept that is well executed.  7.</td>', 'Nice job of blending the images together.  I think the idea of you looking at yourself is funny.  Good concept that is well executed.  7.', '2008-01-08 07:49:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4373178, 629284, 82534, '<td valign="top">I love how you caught the image on the bottom of the board!  It adds so much visual interest to the image.  Also, good job with the editing . I see a few halos around some of the captures, but not enough to be distracting.</td>', 'I love how you caught the image on the bottom of the board!  It adds so much visual interest to the image.  Also, good job with the editing . I see a few halos around some of the captures, but not enough to be distracting.', '2008-01-08 07:50:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4373179, 629406, 82534, '<td valign="top">Great time-lapse entry!  Love how the balls have a blue tint to them -- it gives the image such punch.  Very nice!</td>', 'Great time-lapse entry!  Love how the balls have a blue tint to them -- it gives the image such punch.  Very nice!', '2008-01-08 07:50:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4373180, 629501, 63267, '<td valign="top">Please help me on this one.  I am not seeing anything that spells out Time Lapse to me.  You have a great photo of a cat, and the sky looks wiled, though a bit wierd at that same time, but I just don''t see Time Lapes.  6.</td>', 'Please help me on this one.  I am not seeing anything that spells out Time Lapse to me.  You have a great photo of a cat, and the sky looks wiled, though a bit wierd at that same time, but I just don''t see Time Lapes.  6.', '2008-01-08 07:50:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4373181, 629546, 82534, '<td valign="top">I love the smooth transition to night.  Many people tried this, but you made it work!</td>', 'I love the smooth transition to night.  Many people tried this, but you made it work!', '2008-01-08 07:51:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4373182, 629295, 63267, '<td valign="top">I think you have a neat idea here, but the translucent cat kills it for me.  5.</td>', 'I think you have a neat idea here, but the translucent cat kills it for me.  5.', '2008-01-08 07:51:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4373189, 629583, 63267, '<td valign="top">My first thought was cool golfing shot, especially with the sky.  But then I saw two balls in the frame and that kind of ruined it for me.  The Sun over the horizon is a bit of a distraction as well.  Looking at the image in general, I have to wonder why someone is teeing off right next to the green.  In the end I think it is a cool shot that is just troubled by some minor details.  6.</td>', 'My first thought was cool golfing shot, especially with the sky.  But then I saw two balls in the frame and that kind of ruined it for me.  The Sun over the horizon is a bit of a distraction as well.  Looking at the image in general, I have to wonder why someone is teeing off right next to the green.  In the end I think it is a cool shot that is just troubled by some minor details.  6.', '2008-01-08 07:54:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4373193, 628481, 63267, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot.  If you are receiving comments from the same people that commented on mine, then they are probably going to say you have too many frames bunched together.  Unfortunately they will look past the 8 riders you have and the title and how it all ties in with the theme of Rodeo riding.  For that I say forget them!<br/> <br/> <br/>Great image, and the only rodeo one I have seen.  Best of luck with my 9.</td>', 'This is a great shot.  If you are receiving comments from the same people that commented on mine, then they are probably going to say you have too many frames bunched together.  Unfortunately they will look past the 8 riders you have and the title and how it all ties in with the theme of Rodeo riding.  For that I say forget them!  Great image, and the only rodeo one I have seen.  Best of luck with my 9.', '2008-01-08 07:55:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4373196, 629494, 63267, '<td valign="top">Very nice image.  How long did  your camera have to sit there to get this shot?  My only quip is with the tranlucent petals.  Still a great idea well executed.  8.</td>', 'Very nice image.  How long did  your camera have to sit there to get this shot?  My only quip is with the tranlucent petals.  Still a great idea well executed.  8.', '2008-01-08 07:56:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4373198, 629751, 63267, '<td valign="top">I like the depth of field here and the lighting.  The shot doesn''t have a lot of action, but it does have some time lapse.  Well done and worth an 8.</td>', 'I like the depth of field here and the lighting.  The shot doesn''t have a lot of action, but it does have some time lapse.  Well done and worth an 8.', '2008-01-08 07:57:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4373200, 629708, 63267, '<td valign="top">I really like the idea of the HDTR, I just find the hard lines to be distracting in the image.  If it were blended more than I could appreciate this photo more.  6.</td>', 'I really like the idea of the HDTR, I just find the hard lines to be distracting in the image.  If it were blended more than I could appreciate this photo more.  6.', '2008-01-08 07:58:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4373225, 629961, 67697, '<td valign="top">I keep coming back to this one.  It''s beautiful.  I don''t know what you did with the processing but I just love the mysterious flow.  I hope it ribbons! (10)</td>', 'I keep coming back to this one.  It''s beautiful.  I don''t know what you did with the processing but I just love the mysterious flow.  I hope it ribbons! (10)', '2008-01-08 08:08:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4373226, 629908, 63267, '<td valign="top">I like the bw treatment here.  This image has that desolate child playing on his own because he has no neighbors feel to it.  It is a great shot.  I do think that spacing the child out a bit more would have helped the image some.  6.</td>', 'I like the bw treatment here.  This image has that desolate child playing on his own because he has no neighbors feel to it.  It is a great shot.  I do think that spacing the child out a bit more would have helped the image some.  6.', '2008-01-08 08:08:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4373228, 629863, 79057, '<td valign="top">Nice capture</td>', 'Nice capture', '2008-01-08 08:08:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4373231, 628727, 63267, '<td valign="top">This is a great use of the HDTR technique.  While everyone else is doing horizontal stitches, you stepped it up a bit.  Brilliant.  8.</td>', 'This is a great use of the HDTR technique.  While everyone else is doing horizontal stitches, you stepped it up a bit.  Brilliant.  8.', '2008-01-08 08:08:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4373233, 629961, 79057, '<td valign="top">Very interesting</td>', 'Very interesting', '2008-01-08 08:09:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4373309, 629131, 33515, '<td valign="top">You really went all out on the processing of this one, and to me it was very well done. The horizon seems to dip to the left some but other that that...</td>', 'You really went all out on the processing of this one, and to me it was very well done. The horizon seems to dip to the left some but other that that...', '2008-01-08 08:34:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4373327, 629339, 33515, '<td valign="top">Made me jump a bit! The results are good and high marks for that, the blending of exposures is spot on. I''m not sure the Lion, or this poise, was the best choice as far as appeal, looks like you created a new breed of 3 headed Lion that is unsettling to me. 8</td>', 'Made me jump a bit! The results are good and high marks for that, the blending of exposures is spot on. I''m not sure the Lion, or this poise, was the best choice as far as appeal, looks like you created a new breed of 3 headed Lion that is unsettling to me. 8', '2008-01-08 08:41:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4373332, 629087, 55005, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites from the challenge.  Really cool.</td>', 'One of my favorites from the challenge.  Really cool.', '2008-01-08 08:44:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4373352, 629546, 55005, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image!  Love the colors here.  I think that the title would go with the image better if you flip the photo horizontally.</td>', 'Beautiful image!  Love the colors here.  I think that the title would go with the image better if you flip the photo horizontally.', '2008-01-08 08:50:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4373354, 629284, 55005, '<td valign="top">Very cool.  Love the "jumping at you" effect.  One of my favorites in this challenge.</td>', 'Very cool.  Love the "jumping at you" effect.  One of my favorites in this challenge.', '2008-01-08 08:51:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4373355, 629131, 55005, '<td valign="top">This is just really, really cool.  There is so much to look at, the colors are superb and that double rainbow is just perfect.</td>', 'This is just really, really cool.  There is so much to look at, the colors are superb and that double rainbow is just perfect.', '2008-01-08 08:53:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4373364, 629087, 81382, '<td valign="top">Thought about doing something very similar myself. Lovely colours and non-distracting background, although a bit of a glow around the outside of the bowl - can''t be helped I suppose</td>', 'Thought about doing something very similar myself. Lovely colours and non-distracting background, although a bit of a glow around the outside of the bowl - can''t be helped I suppose', '2008-01-08 08:56:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4373378, 629557, 81382, '<td valign="top">Very difficult lighting and you''ve done so well to freeze frame each position without any blur. Difficult setup requiring the live active and so overall a very high technical merit. I''ve been playing around with HDR recently since the rule change and the background looks possibly like you used this technique but obviously this would be impossible for the guy on the bike. So I reckon you may have had 3+ captures for the background plus another 5 for the action so I fully understand the amound of effort thats gone into this. Well done all round</td>', 'Very difficult lighting and you''ve done so well to freeze frame each position without any blur. Difficult setup requiring the live active and so overall a very high technical merit. I''ve been playing around with HDR recently since the rule change and the background looks possibly like you used this technique but obviously this would be impossible for the guy on the bike. So I reckon you may have had 3+ captures for the background plus another 5 for the action so I fully understand the amound of effort thats gone into this. Well done all round', '2008-01-08 09:00:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4373387, 629186, 81382, '<td valign="top">Well composed, nice and simple concept. I worry that compared to some of the others I have voted on so far that the "relatively easy" technical difficultly might prevent a high score</td>', 'Well composed, nice and simple concept. I worry that compared to some of the others I have voted on so far that the "relatively easy" technical difficultly might prevent a high score', '2008-01-08 09:02:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4373432, 628021, 66384, '<td valign="top">This HDR is gorgeous. I love the rich colors. Beautiful scent and composition. The little paper boat is a fun idea. 10</td>', 'This HDR is gorgeous. I love the rich colors. Beautiful scent and composition. The little paper boat is a fun idea. 10', '2008-01-08 09:17:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4373434, 629087, 66384, '<td valign="top">How exquisite! Beautiful light and color. I love the way you combined the images with varying opacity. 10</td>', 'How exquisite! Beautiful light and color. I love the way you combined the images with varying opacity. 10', '2008-01-08 09:17:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4373435, 629961, 66384, '<td valign="top">This is a truly amazing image. I don''t know that the light web is, and I can''t distinguish what is actually changing over time, but I love this effect. I hope you will share your process with us. 10</td>', 'This is a truly amazing image. I don''t know that the light web is, and I can''t distinguish what is actually changing over time, but I love this effect. I hope you will share your process with us. 10', '2008-01-08 09:18:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4373436, 629335, 66384, '<td valign="top">I really like this natural b&amp;w with the touch of red. I like the way the man and woman create the alternating red and gray in the lineup. And I like the tree and street lamp framing the image. Beautiful processing. 10</td>', 'I really like this natural b&w with the touch of red. I like the way the man and woman create the alternating red and gray in the lineup. And I like the tree and street lamp framing the image. Beautiful processing. 10', '2008-01-08 09:18:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4373438, 628788, 66384, '<td valign="top">What a great idea and beautiful image.</td>', 'What a great idea and beautiful image.', '2008-01-08 09:18:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4373440, 629739, 66384, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, beautiful, beautiful. Ho difficult this merge must have been, and how well you did it! I love the scene, the colors, and the action. This would make a great jigsaw puzzle. 10</td>', 'Beautiful, beautiful, beautiful. Ho difficult this merge must have been, and how well you did it! I love the scene, the colors, and the action. This would make a great jigsaw puzzle. 10', '2008-01-08 09:19:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4373445, 629757, 51793, '<td valign="top">I love this. Good Job<br/>10</td>', 'I love this. Good Job10', '2008-01-08 09:21:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4373451, 629686, 81382, '<td valign="top">Two things initially come to mind, orange colour cast and non-traditional border - but I''m pleased to say I think both work here. Perhaps the orange is a little overdone but it completements the field and contrasts well with the blue water. The border gives it a video game feel and gives the image a "development animation" feel - hope that makes sense. The composition seems a bit weighted on the right hand side - two figures + stream verses just the one figure on the left.</td>', 'Two things initially come to mind, orange colour cast and non-traditional border - but I''m pleased to say I think both work here. Perhaps the orange is a little overdone but it completements the field and contrasts well with the blue water. The border gives it a video game feel and gives the image a "development animation" feel - hope that makes sense. The composition seems a bit weighted on the right hand side - two figures + stream verses just the one figure on the left.', '2008-01-08 09:23:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4373454, 629425, 81382, '<td valign="top">Just lacking sharpness unfortunately, really bright/sharp/constrasty coloured fish against the dull/blurred background would have been great to see. You also have a bit of purple fringing would could easily have been supressed.</td>', 'Just lacking sharpness unfortunately, really bright/sharp/constrasty coloured fish against the dull/blurred background would have been great to see. You also have a bit of purple fringing would could easily have been supressed.', '2008-01-08 09:25:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4373484, 629757, 81382, '<td valign="top">If only the spacing was consistent between the back 4 and front 3. The rest of it is spot on, great B&amp;W conversion, lovely tones, clever signs and title. The lampost is a bit unfortunate, you might have been able to obscure it with the forground sign without effecting the rest of the composition.</td>', 'If only the spacing was consistent between the back 4 and front 3. The rest of it is spot on, great B&W conversion, lovely tones, clever signs and title. The lampost is a bit unfortunate, you might have been able to obscure it with the forground sign without effecting the rest of the composition.', '2008-01-08 09:47:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4373488, 629883, 81382, '<td valign="top">Lack of shadows is a bit odd and some positions are sharper than others. Might have been more consistent (spacing wise) to have just one position on the backswing rather than 2. Other than that, good B&amp;W conversion and use of the wide aspect ratio frame</td>', 'Lack of shadows is a bit odd and some positions are sharper than others. Might have been more consistent (spacing wise) to have just one position on the backswing rather than 2. Other than that, good B&W conversion and use of the wide aspect ratio frame', '2008-01-08 09:49:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4373493, 629701, 81382, '<td valign="top">Overly complex title. Having the transparency is something others have not done and it well works here to show "age" of position and also serves to prevent the image being dominated with a lot of brights red and white.</td>', 'Overly complex title. Having the transparency is something others have not done and it well works here to show "age" of position and also serves to prevent the image being dominated with a lot of brights red and white.', '2008-01-08 09:52:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4373497, 629284, 81382, '<td valign="top">Nice touch with the border, its not often people submit an image using that technique but it complements the image subject well. Positions of the snow boarder are consistent which others have failed to achieve so well done for that.</td>', 'Nice touch with the border, its not often people submit an image using that technique but it complements the image subject well. Positions of the snow boarder are consistent which others have failed to achieve so well done for that.', '2008-01-08 09:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4373500, 629339, 81382, '<td valign="top">Clever post processing but just not my cup of tea I''m afraid - its bordering on freaky!</td>', 'Clever post processing but just not my cup of tea I''m afraid - its bordering on freaky!', '2008-01-08 09:56:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4373539, 629885, 81382, '<td valign="top">Excellent freeze frame captures and well composed</td>', 'Excellent freeze frame captures and well composed', '2008-01-08 10:17:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4373542, 629952, 81382, '<td valign="top">Clever concept. Not compromised by any distracting background elements - just nice and simple and strongly coloured</td>', 'Clever concept. Not compromised by any distracting background elements - just nice and simple and strongly coloured', '2008-01-08 10:18:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4373546, 629863, 81382, '<td valign="top">Well composed with the eye being lead across the diagonal and with the rule of thirds being obeyed in pretty much every respect. The masking around the wings in places could be a little more accurate or at least a touch more feathered</td>', 'Well composed with the eye being lead across the diagonal and with the rule of thirds being obeyed in pretty much every respect. The masking around the wings in places could be a little more accurate or at least a touch more feathered', '2008-01-08 10:20:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4373552, 629546, 81382, '<td valign="top">Lovely deep tones. Well composed. Day turning to night (I figured it out in the end :-)). I was getting a little concerned that I could find the subject in 3-5 different positions and I''m so glad I couldn''t, nice to see something unique.</td>', 'Lovely deep tones. Well composed. Day turning to night (I figured it out in the end :-)). I was getting a little concerned that I could find the subject in 3-5 different positions and I''m so glad I couldn''t, nice to see something unique.', '2008-01-08 10:24:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4373554, 629600, 81382, '<td valign="top">The tonal range used on the bird is a little dull. The gravel is where the brightest white can be found and would be better placed on the chest feathers instead.</td>', 'The tonal range used on the bird is a little dull. The gravel is where the brightest white can be found and would be better placed on the chest feathers instead.', '2008-01-08 10:25:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4373557, 629494, 81382, '<td valign="top">Nice title. If this is genuine, you have done well generating the captures required - I''m guessing over a number of days.</td>', 'Nice title. If this is genuine, you have done well generating the captures required - I''m guessing over a number of days.', '2008-01-08 10:27:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4373786, 629961, 30214, '<td valign="top">wow this is very interesting! would love to see how it is done.</td>', 'wow this is very interesting! would love to see how it is done.', '2008-01-08 11:39:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4373792, 628727, 30214, '<td valign="top">i don''t see time lapse effect here</td>', 'i don''t see time lapse effect here', '2008-01-08 11:40:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4373800, 629756, 30214, '<td valign="top">I believe that you used multiple exposures, but this effect could be easily achieved without it in post-processing</td>', 'I believe that you used multiple exposures, but this effect could be easily achieved without it in post-processing', '2008-01-08 11:42:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4373813, 628989, 69102, '<td valign="top">nice colors, but in the end we''re still just looking at the back of the skier. would have been much more visually interesting if he was approaching the camera.</td>', 'nice colors, but in the end we''re still just looking at the back of the skier. would have been much more visually interesting if he was approaching the camera.', '2008-01-08 11:46:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4373815, 629961, 69102, '<td valign="top">creepy cool!</td>', 'creepy cool!', '2008-01-08 11:47:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4373818, 629757, 69102, '<td valign="top">a little more separation between the planes would have made this even better.</td>', 'a little more separation between the planes would have made this even better.', '2008-01-08 11:48:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4373826, 629223, 57229, '<td valign="top">Tricky little number with the chains :-) Good freezing of motion and a nice overall composition. Good model, give him a peanut.</td>', 'Tricky little number with the chains :-) Good freezing of motion and a nice overall composition. Good model, give him a peanut.', '2008-01-08 11:49:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4373834, 628989, 57229, '<td valign="top">Skier(s) glow a bit. Good idea.</td>', 'Skier(s) glow a bit. Good idea.', '2008-01-08 11:51:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4373835, 628021, 69102, '<td valign="top">interesting photo, but the boat doesn''t stand out</td>', 'interesting photo, but the boat doesn''t stand out', '2008-01-08 11:51:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4373836, 629339, 69102, '<td valign="top">makes it look like a creepy two-headed lion.</td>', 'makes it look like a creepy two-headed lion.', '2008-01-08 11:51:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4373839, 629739, 57229, '<td valign="top">Good capture, bit chaotic over the fuzzed up (blown out?) foreground. Extra point(s) for being there.</td>', 'Good capture, bit chaotic over the fuzzed up (blown out?) foreground. Extra point(s) for being there.', '2008-01-08 11:53:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4373875, 629577, 57229, '<td valign="top">Personally, I find shots of idiots behaving like this a lot less interesting than cats and flowers, but this is one hell of a shot. I can see small masking problems on the right side of the middle figure, but otherwise your choices of inclusion and exclusion of details from the individual exposures has been v. good. (In My Pathetically Insignificant Opinion). Quite apart from having successfully accomplished the lots-of-exposures-jammed-into-one-shot thingy of the new rules, this is also a stand-alone picture. There''ll be points for that...</td>', 'Personally, I find shots of idiots behaving like this a lot less interesting than cats and flowers, but this is one hell of a shot. I can see small masking problems on the right side of the middle figure, but otherwise your choices of inclusion and exclusion of details from the individual exposures has been v. good. (In My Pathetically Insignificant Opinion). Quite apart from having successfully accomplished the lots-of-exposures-jammed-into-one-shot thingy of the new rules, this is also a stand-alone picture. There''ll be points for that...', '2008-01-08 12:03:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4373876, 629448, 57229, '<td valign="top">Sod the technical tricksters. Brave move.</td>', 'Sod the technical tricksters. Brave move.', '2008-01-08 12:03:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4373881, 628481, 57229, '<td valign="top">Well captured and well processed - pretty much faultlessly so. It''s a shame that it looks as though one of the shots alone might have been more exciting that the whole lot :-)</td>', 'Well captured and well processed - pretty much faultlessly so. It''s a shame that it looks as though one of the shots alone might have been more exciting that the whole lot :-)', '2008-01-08 12:05:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4373887, 628714, 57229, '<td valign="top">Lovely picture. You''ve done a great job of retaining the reflections in the water (or is the back one missing a bit?) so as to prevent them looking pasted in. Bonus quacking sequence too! I rate this highly.</td>', 'Lovely picture. You''ve done a great job of retaining the reflections in the water (or is the back one missing a bit?) so as to prevent them looking pasted in. Bonus quacking sequence too! I rate this highly.', '2008-01-08 12:08:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4373896, 629825, 57229, '<td valign="top">More good than great, but it''s all there - composition, (natural?) movement sequence, frozen motion, focus... maybe some over saturated colours and jpeg-y snow make it less than breathtaking, but daddy shall have points.</td>', 'More good than great, but it''s all there - composition, (natural?) movement sequence, frozen motion, focus... maybe some over saturated colours and jpeg-y snow make it less than breathtaking, but daddy shall have points.', '2008-01-08 12:12:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4373902, 629448, 81382, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, just dont think its in the spirit of the challange given the recent rule changes. The brief specifically states multiple captures and if it this is the case here, the end result could easily be achieved in easier ways.</td>', 'Nice idea, just dont think its in the spirit of the challange given the recent rule changes. The brief specifically states multiple captures and if it this is the case here, the end result could easily be achieved in easier ways.', '2008-01-08 12:15:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4373905, 629725, 57229, '<td valign="top">Very nice figurative abstract look. Falling petal would have done for me, but still... I''m not clever enough to say how, but I think such a stark minimal image requires a lot of attention to composition and balance of abstract elements. Great concept though, and lovely stuff going on there.</td>', 'Very nice figurative abstract look. Falling petal would have done for me, but still... I''m not clever enough to say how, but I think such a stark minimal image requires a lot of attention to composition and balance of abstract elements. Great concept though, and lovely stuff going on there.', '2008-01-08 12:17:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4373906, 628727, 81382, '<td valign="top">Similar to another entry but the idea is great non-the-less and avoids the "multiple object in different positions syndrome" so it good to see something different. Just seems a little noisy in places which is a shame</td>', 'Similar to another entry but the idea is great non-the-less and avoids the "multiple object in different positions syndrome" so it good to see something different. Just seems a little noisy in places which is a shame', '2008-01-08 12:17:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4373907, 629883, 57229, '<td valign="top">I just know you''ll forgive me for saying this is corny as all get out, but a great sequence, thanks for the fun...</td>', 'I just know you''ll forgive me for saying this is corny as all get out, but a great sequence, thanks for the fun...', '2008-01-08 12:18:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4373917, 628985, 57229, '<td valign="top">Hey, who''s the guy with the yellow jacket? Good show, over saturated for my eyes, but cracked the challenge and the - er - rules :-)</td>', 'Hey, who''s the guy with the yellow jacket? Good show, over saturated for my eyes, but cracked the challenge and the - er - rules :-)', '2008-01-08 12:20:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4373926, 628714, 81382, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting, the ducks being unnaturally close together is the only problem I have with this. Perhaps if you have made them get a bit smaller (only very slightly) into the image then this might have helped to make things more realistic. Although, having said all that, realism most certainly isn''t important in this challange, I''m just justifying why this isn''t working for me in this instance</td>', 'Nice lighting, the ducks being unnaturally close together is the only problem I have with this. Perhaps if you have made them get a bit smaller (only very slightly) into the image then this might have helped to make things more realistic. Although, having said all that, realism most certainly isn''t important in this challange, I''m just justifying why this isn''t working for me in this instance', '2008-01-08 12:23:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4373929, 629944, 81382, '<td valign="top">Focus seems to be on the fretboard and not on the fingers. The fingers are the main subjects in this image and should be the sharpest areas - or at least equal sharpness to the fretboard</td>', 'Focus seems to be on the fretboard and not on the fingers. The fingers are the main subjects in this image and should be the sharpest areas - or at least equal sharpness to the fretboard', '2008-01-08 12:25:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4373933, 629223, 81382, '<td valign="top">Just a shame the spacing isn''t perfectly equal, its just the one far left that isn''t conforming and perhaps the image would have been better without it.</td>', 'Just a shame the spacing isn''t perfectly equal, its just the one far left that isn''t conforming and perhaps the image would have been better without it.', '2008-01-08 12:26:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4373938, 629850, 81382, '<td valign="top">Similar to another entry but this is far superior IMO. More fingers, all in focus, simple background, balanced tones. You have demonstrated good post-processing skills and the hardwork this must have taken is worth it.</td>', 'Similar to another entry but this is far superior IMO. More fingers, all in focus, simple background, balanced tones. You have demonstrated good post-processing skills and the hardwork this must have taken is worth it.', '2008-01-08 12:28:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4373960, 629962, 81382, '<td valign="top">Combined long exposure with time lapse. Composition is a bit strange having the skyline almost off the bottome of the frame, a bit more space with some nice reflections at the bottom might have helped balance things up a bit. Alternatively, a portrait aspect ratio with reflections of the fireworks in might have been possible.</td>', 'Combined long exposure with time lapse. Composition is a bit strange having the skyline almost off the bottome of the frame, a bit more space with some nice reflections at the bottom might have helped balance things up a bit. Alternatively, a portrait aspect ratio with reflections of the fireworks in might have been possible.', '2008-01-08 12:40:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4373983, 629406, 81382, '<td valign="top">Possibly the sharpest image ever to be dislayed on my monitor!!</td>', 'Possibly the sharpest image ever to be dislayed on my monitor!!', '2008-01-08 12:48:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4373990, 629852, 57229, '<td valign="top">Tell him I saw him smiling once, so he better not show his face in public again.<br/> <br/>More seriously - this is an exemplary sequence of what looks like some pretty exemplary moves. Just to be nickety pickety I can see one or two places where e.g. jeans have been masked out against trees and the line is too hard - maybe a little blur or smudge would have helped there. Then again, as all the shots have the same background it shouldn''t have been necessary to paint the mask right in to the jeans anyway. Maybe it''s me hallucinating again. Give me a pint of what I''m drinking. Oh. I''ve  a powerful suspicion of Neat Image pollution too...<br/> <br/>having said all that I''ll wind my crying neck in as it''s a whole lot better than anything I could have done, and in difficult lighting, too.</td>', 'Tell him I saw him smiling once, so he better not show his face in public again. More seriously - this is an exemplary sequence of what looks like some pretty exemplary moves. Just to be nickety pickety I can see one or two places where e.g. jeans have been masked out against trees and the line is too hard - maybe a little blur or smudge would have helped there. Then again, as all the shots have the same background it shouldn''t have been necessary to paint the mask right in to the jeans anyway. Maybe it''s me hallucinating again. Give me a pint of what I''m drinking. Oh. I''ve  a powerful suspicion of Neat Image pollution too... having said all that I''ll wind my crying neck in as it''s a whole lot better than anything I could have done, and in difficult lighting, too.', '2008-01-08 12:51:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4373991, 629757, 57229, '<td valign="top">Pretty cool to include those signs, heh. Nice idea.</td>', 'Pretty cool to include those signs, heh. Nice idea.', '2008-01-08 12:53:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4373992, 629658, 72268, '<td valign="top">Beautiful Scene</td>', 'Beautiful Scene', '2008-01-08 12:53:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4373995, 629087, 72268, '<td valign="top">I would hang this on my wall! I love this. My kind of photo! Good Job.</td>', 'I would hang this on my wall! I love this. My kind of photo! Good Job.', '2008-01-08 12:53:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4373997, 629226, 72268, '<td valign="top">A little grainy, not very interesting to me. Good comp and idea though!</td>', 'A little grainy, not very interesting to me. Good comp and idea though!', '2008-01-08 12:54:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4373999, 628788, 81382, '<td valign="top">Dawn, day, dusk.... thats dedication. Lovely wide angle. The ground is very close to the bottom edge of the frame and so having a bit more ground visible to be close the rule of thirds would balance things up slighly.</td>', 'Dawn, day, dusk.... thats dedication. Lovely wide angle. The ground is very close to the bottom edge of the frame and so having a bit more ground visible to be close the rule of thirds would balance things up slighly.', '2008-01-08 12:54:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4374001, 629883, 72268, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! Love it.</td>', 'Beautiful! Love it.', '2008-01-08 12:54:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4374002, 629494, 72268, '<td valign="top">Very interesting. Another great photo!</td>', 'Very interesting. Another great photo!', '2008-01-08 12:55:02.000000', NULL, 1),
