(4374010, 629744, 57229, '<td valign="top">I hate it when pictures are for story telling. I hate it even more when they do it so damned well. Then I have to like the picture that''s doing the story telling and I have to hate myself for not having liked it in the first place. Hang on, I''m in a loop.<br/>Seriously good application of the technique here.</td>', 'I hate it when pictures are for story telling. I hate it even more when they do it so damned well. Then I have to like the picture that''s doing the story telling and I have to hate myself for not having liked it in the first place. Hang on, I''m in a loop.Seriously good application of the technique here.', '2008-01-08 12:56:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4374012, 629284, 72268, '<td valign="top">I love how it pops out at you. Great work!</td>', 'I love how it pops out at you. Great work!', '2008-01-08 12:56:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4374014, 629630, 72268, '<td valign="top">To me, the subject is a little plain, I think maybe if the car was a bright color Red for example, this photo would have "popped"! Still good idea and comp.</td>', 'To me, the subject is a little plain, I think maybe if the car was a bright color Red for example, this photo would have "popped"! Still good idea and comp.', '2008-01-08 12:57:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4374015, 629658, 57229, '<td valign="top">Nice one, I''m surprised there aren''t more of these - it''s sort of what the challenge (if not the rules :-)) is crying out for.</td>', 'Nice one, I''m surprised there aren''t more of these - it''s sort of what the challenge (if not the rules :-)) is crying out for.', '2008-01-08 12:57:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4374016, 629708, 81382, '<td valign="top">Blended with a gradient would have been amazing and the divisions are quite distracting.</td>', 'Blended with a gradient would have been amazing and the divisions are quite distracting.', '2008-01-08 12:57:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4374017, 629284, 68852, '<td valign="top">Very cool shot. Seamless. Good job.</td>', 'Very cool shot. Seamless. Good job.', '2008-01-08 12:57:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4374024, 629739, 81382, '<td valign="top">Other similar techniques have been rather unnatural and are obviously multiple captures where as this could be a single image. Therefore it meets and challange in a rathr subtle special way. Great colours - well done</td>', 'Other similar techniques have been rather unnatural and are obviously multiple captures where as this could be a single image. Therefore it meets and challange in a rathr subtle special way. Great colours - well done', '2008-01-08 12:59:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4374025, 629863, 57229, '<td valign="top">Seriously beautiful picture - all sharp and coloured and composed. I think you''ll win.</td>', 'Seriously beautiful picture - all sharp and coloured and composed. I think you''ll win.', '2008-01-08 12:59:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4374026, 629557, 68852, '<td valign="top">This is very cool. I like the detail...</td>', 'This is very cool. I like the detail...', '2008-01-08 12:59:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4374027, 627641, 72268, '<td valign="top">Im more attracted to the wall then I am to the subject. Next time, I would make the background less distracting, good idea though.</td>', 'Im more attracted to the wall then I am to the subject. Next time, I would make the background less distracting, good idea though.', '2008-01-08 13:00:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4374035, 629708, 68852, '<td valign="top">I have always wanted to do a photo like this. Great Work. Ive always wanted to do one with the seasons... One in winter, spring, summer and fall. Awesome work.</td>', 'I have always wanted to do a photo like this. Great Work. Ive always wanted to do one with the seasons... One in winter, spring, summer and fall. Awesome work.', '2008-01-08 13:02:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4374038, 628021, 57229, '<td valign="top">Ooh, is it bring news of the HRD Vincent? This HD stuff (nearly) always has a touch of the virtual reality about it. I''d venture that here it''s just a smidgeon over the top - but that''s me. Magnificent curve of the Newsworthy''s Odessy. . .</td>', 'Ooh, is it bring news of the HRD Vincent? This HD stuff (nearly) always has a touch of the virtual reality about it. I''d venture that here it''s just a smidgeon over the top - but that''s me. Magnificent curve of the Newsworthy''s Odessy. . .', '2008-01-08 13:03:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4374049, 629630, 57229, '<td valign="top">Sort of accomplishes the task but brings no more to the table. Shame, really - apart from being a magnificently maintained old vehicle, it comes over as a wee bit bland. Still ''n all, you have to have at least 5 just for giving the sc something to try out their new rules on :-)</td>', 'Sort of accomplishes the task but brings no more to the table. Shame, really - apart from being a magnificently maintained old vehicle, it comes over as a wee bit bland. Still ''n all, you have to have at least 5 just for giving the sc something to try out their new rules on :-)', '2008-01-08 13:09:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4374055, 629944, 57229, '<td valign="top">Nice idea - I wonder about a touch of movement blur? Boom baba boom.</td>', 'Nice idea - I wonder about a touch of movement blur? Boom baba boom.', '2008-01-08 13:10:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4374061, 628895, 57229, '<td valign="top">Shouldn''t judge on content, but it sort of makes its point...</td>', 'Shouldn''t judge on content, but it sort of makes its point...', '2008-01-08 13:11:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4374066, 629705, 57229, '<td valign="top">They must''ve enjoyed it - beats having to pose around for stoopid portraits :-)<br/> <br/>Great idea, well done...</td>', 'They must''ve enjoyed it - beats having to pose around for stoopid portraits :-) Great idea, well done...', '2008-01-08 13:13:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4374077, 629339, 57229, '<td valign="top">Strewth. Having looked at this a couple of times before, and in addition given it more than the customary 2 seconds this time around, I can see that not only is this cleverly done and an original take on the challenge, it actually brings something to the majesty of the lion too. He''s somehow even more terribly big and frightening with the three heads.</td>', 'Strewth. Having looked at this a couple of times before, and in addition given it more than the customary 2 seconds this time around, I can see that not only is this cleverly done and an original take on the challenge, it actually brings something to the majesty of the lion too. He''s somehow even more terribly big and frightening with the three heads.', '2008-01-08 13:17:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4374085, 629945, 57229, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. Nice place. There''s something too random about the scattering of kites. Doesn''t give a sense of movement...</td>', 'Nice shot. Nice place. There''s something too random about the scattering of kites. Doesn''t give a sense of movement...', '2008-01-08 13:19:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4374094, 629942, 57229, '<td valign="top">Ow, me too! Good shot - pretty snowy looking snow :-)</td>', 'Ow, me too! Good shot - pretty snowy looking snow :-)', '2008-01-08 13:21:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4374105, 629952, 57229, '<td valign="top">Clever. Nice. I had to think... nuff said.<br/> <br/>Having to think is not so good, really, but the result here is a very nice picture...</td>', 'Clever. Nice. I had to think... nuff said. Having to think is not so good, really, but the result here is a very nice picture...', '2008-01-08 13:22:51.000000', NULL, 1),
