(4374600, 628895, 41802, '<td valign="top">Cool shot, I wish we had a little more focus on the lighting on the shirt, it is kind of distracting.  Good work.</td>', 'Cool shot, I wish we had a little more focus on the lighting on the shirt, it is kind of distracting.  Good work.', '2008-01-08 16:04:29.000000', NULL, 1),
