(4374864, 628788, 37845, '<td valign="top">I love the colours in this, as well as the wide pan. I would probably like to see this in a larger format too, as I imagine it would look that much more incredible. Not sure if it meets the challenge though, but a 7 from me anyway.</td>', 'I love the colours in this, as well as the wide pan. I would probably like to see this in a larger format too, as I imagine it would look that much more incredible. Not sure if it meets the challenge though, but a 7 from me anyway.', '2008-01-08 17:28:25.000000', NULL, 1),
