(4374942, 629284, 84736, '<td valign="top">The concept of this is great. I love how the boarder is jumping out of the frame. What would have made this a ten shot would be the absense of all of the distracting things in the background. The chair, the other boarders, and the lift all distract from the main subject. The other thing is that the shot appears slightly underexposed. The snow is gray instead of a pure white.</td>', 'The concept of this is great. I love how the boarder is jumping out of the frame. What would have made this a ten shot would be the absense of all of the distracting things in the background. The chair, the other boarders, and the lift all distract from the main subject. The other thing is that the shot appears slightly underexposed. The snow is gray instead of a pure white.', '2008-01-08 17:55:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4374984, 629708, 43774, '<td valign="top">I''d like this better if the transition lines weren''t so visible but it''s still a wonderful photo and fits the challenge well.</td>', 'I''d like this better if the transition lines weren''t so visible but it''s still a wonderful photo and fits the challenge well.', '2008-01-08 18:03:35.000000', NULL, 1),
