(4382613, 629708, 23487, '<td valign="top">I wouldn''t have thought to leave the transitions very...obvious, is the best word I can muster up, but it works well.  I really like this.</td>', 'I wouldn''t have thought to leave the transitions very...obvious, is the best word I can muster up, but it works well.  I really like this.', '2008-01-10 19:37:23.000000', NULL, 1),
