(4385464, 629961, 62009, '<td valign="top">I don''t know what to say here.  It looks a lot more like digital editing than it does a time lapse.  Not sure what exactly is going on.</td>', 'I don''t know what to say here.  It looks a lot more like digital editing than it does a time lapse.  Not sure what exactly is going on.', '2008-01-11 17:35:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4385473, 629020, 62009, '<td valign="top">The picture really doesn''t do much for me.  It''s just a guy walking.  There isn''t anything technically wrong that I can find, but I also can''t find anything that''s great about it.</td>', 'The picture really doesn''t do much for me.  It''s just a guy walking.  There isn''t anything technically wrong that I can find, but I also can''t find anything that''s great about it.', '2008-01-11 17:37:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4385475, 629562, 62009, '<td valign="top">This is entirely too orange for me.  I''d like to see some separation of the sky and the water colors from the orange to blue.</td>', 'This is entirely too orange for me.  I''d like to see some separation of the sky and the water colors from the orange to blue.', '2008-01-11 17:38:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4385477, 629938, 62009, '<td valign="top">This is wonderful. It shows the duality (quadrality) of our own personas.  Lighting is great as are the poses.</td>', 'This is wonderful. It shows the duality (quadrality) of our own personas.  Lighting is great as are the poses.', '2008-01-11 17:38:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4385478, 629944, 62009, '<td valign="top">Interesting.  I''d like to see more of you playing the bass.  Also, there are smudges on the bottom of the bass.</td>', 'Interesting.  I''d like to see more of you playing the bass.  Also, there are smudges on the bottom of the bass.', '2008-01-11 17:39:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4385479, 628555, 62009, '<td valign="top">I like how the bird is following the biker in the photo.  The colors are great as is the area.</td>', 'I like how the bird is following the biker in the photo.  The colors are great as is the area.', '2008-01-11 17:40:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4385480, 629823, 62009, '<td valign="top">I like how the colors of the umbrella contrast the mood of the shot.  Dreary and rainy, but bright and playful umbrella.</td>', 'I like how the colors of the umbrella contrast the mood of the shot.  Dreary and rainy, but bright and playful umbrella.', '2008-01-11 17:41:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4385484, 629284, 62009, '<td valign="top">There is way too much going on in this photo.  Too many distractions in the background...the chair, the other people, the lift.</td>', 'There is way too much going on in this photo.  Too many distractions in the background...the chair, the other people, the lift.', '2008-01-11 17:42:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4385488, 629885, 62009, '<td valign="top">The bird is too blurry.  I find that it actually hurts my eyes trying to watch the motion.</td>', 'The bird is too blurry.  I find that it actually hurts my eyes trying to watch the motion.', '2008-01-11 17:42:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4385493, 629686, 62009, '<td valign="top">The huge top and bottom borders take a lot away from this.  I would have also dressed the "actress" in some brightly colored clothes to contrast the dreary grass and trees.</td>', 'The huge top and bottom borders take a lot away from this.  I would have also dressed the "actress" in some brightly colored clothes to contrast the dreary grass and trees.', '2008-01-11 17:43:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4385497, 629948, 62009, '<td valign="top">I really like the action in this.  It flows very well.</td>', 'I really like the action in this.  It flows very well.', '2008-01-11 17:44:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4385499, 629687, 62009, '<td valign="top">Not very interesting seeing a clock on an x-ray.  The clock isn''t as sharp as it could be.</td>', 'Not very interesting seeing a clock on an x-ray.  The clock isn''t as sharp as it could be.', '2008-01-11 17:45:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4385503, 627954, 62009, '<td valign="top">The legs on the 2nd from the right are a bit blurry, perhaps from the motion.  I also would have continued her all the way across.</td>', 'The legs on the 2nd from the right are a bit blurry, perhaps from the motion.  I also would have continued her all the way across.', '2008-01-11 17:46:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4385509, 629557, 62009, '<td valign="top">Good capture.  I like the grungier effect on this.  I would have found some clothes to make the subject stand out more from all of the brown in the frame.</td>', 'Good capture.  I like the grungier effect on this.  I would have found some clothes to make the subject stand out more from all of the brown in the frame.', '2008-01-11 17:47:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4385511, 629852, 62009, '<td valign="top">Not as interesting as some of the other skate shots in the challenge.  Perhaps shooting it from the side than from the front angle.</td>', 'Not as interesting as some of the other skate shots in the challenge.  Perhaps shooting it from the side than from the front angle.', '2008-01-11 17:47:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4385514, 629708, 62009, '<td valign="top">I like the attempt at a day to night time lapse.  but the transitions are way too strong.  Perhaps more of a gradient change would have been better.</td>', 'I like the attempt at a day to night time lapse.  but the transitions are way too strong.  Perhaps more of a gradient change would have been better.', '2008-01-11 17:48:20.000000', NULL, 1);
