(4385715, 628727, 69246, '<td valign="top">This took me a little to see the time lapse concept. After seeing those left to right, I noticed yours was top to bottom. Good transition, but it looks a little too smooth in that it looks as though its a single shot. But a very good attempt.<br/> <br/>Only critque is that it is a little noisy. Points given for the creativy in this shot.</td>', 'This took me a little to see the time lapse concept. After seeing those left to right, I noticed yours was top to bottom. Good transition, but it looks a little too smooth in that it looks as though its a single shot. But a very good attempt. Only critque is that it is a little noisy. Points given for the creativy in this shot.', '2008-01-11 20:15:40.000000', NULL, 1),
