(4390321, 629739, 66384, '<td valign="top">I am astonished at the score on this. I expected it to ribbon. I can''t believe some of these comments saying things like the woods are too busy and they can''t see the deer''s face, and that the deer is blended with the brush. I guess these people have never seen a deer in the wild or know anything about natural camouflage.</td>', 'I am astonished at the score on this. I expected it to ribbon. I can''t believe some of these comments saying things like the woods are too busy and they can''t see the deer''s face, and that the deer is blended with the brush. I guess these people have never seen a deer in the wild or know anything about natural camouflage.', '2008-01-14 00:20:28.000000', NULL, 0),
