(4390324, 629562, 30861, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by colorcarnival:</b></div><hr/><i> Well, I liked it and I just wonder what it was about the photo that made you predict the voter reaction. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>It''s very static in a challenge that more or less demands a more dynamic interpretation. Your flowers are one of the highest-finishing "static" images in the challenge.</td>', 'Originally posted by colorcarnival: Well, I liked it and I just wonder what it was about the photo that made you predict the voter reaction.   It''s very static in a challenge that more or less demands a more dynamic interpretation. Your flowers are one of the highest-finishing "static" images in the challenge.', '2008-01-14 00:20:57.000000', NULL, 0),
