(4390513, 629961, 34618, '<td valign="top">That''s very odd indeed. This image placed 12th in the Challenge as posted on DPC <i>after </i>the challenge ended. I have a saved web page noting it, and yet now it is disqualified?? Hmmmmm. I would have noted that in my 1:18 am (post closing) message if only I had known they would take it away from me AFTER first awarding it. Good thing it didn''t get a ribbon.  <br/> <br/>Any comments on that???<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-01-14 01:48:27.</i></td>', 'That''s very odd indeed. This image placed 12th in the Challenge as posted on DPC after the challenge ended. I have a saved web page noting it, and yet now it is disqualified?? Hmmmmm. I would have noted that in my 1:18 am (post closing) message if only I had known they would take it away from me AFTER first awarding it. Good thing it didn''t get a ribbon.   Any comments on that???', '2008-01-14 01:42:43.000000', '2008-01-14 01:48:27.000000', 0),
