(4391478, 629284, 67145, '<td valign="top">hey benjamin .. i''ve just read your comments on this image  and i reckon the chair, the lift and the other ppl give the snowboarder an great environment .. often with this sort''v photography there can be elements that dont totally work but its real life and not a setup which adds to its appeal ..  perfect number of frames IMO &amp; that border is a master stroke .. i''d say it lifted your score quite a lot ...<br/>i had a look thru this challenge but didnt vote .. i had an image that caused a lot of controversy because the sc said i''d get a dq if i entered it .. they made assumptions about the image that were incorrect and even after further info they didnt retract their opinion .. i could have still entered it but didnt want to risk the dq .. its such a fine line as to wot will be accepted and wot wont with this new time lapse rule .. they said non-linear wasnt time lapse !! .. anyway i''m not saying anything negative about the sc .. they do the best job and a very difficult one i reckon in situations like my image .. <br/>anyway .. like i was saying !!!<br/>i had a look thru this challenge in voting and this one of yours just jumped right out at me !!! ... literally .. <br/>so congratulations on your new pb and a brilliant addition to your portfolio .. it looks just fantastic on your profile page .. :)</td>', 'hey benjamin .. i''ve just read your comments on this image  and i reckon the chair, the lift and the other ppl give the snowboarder an great environment .. often with this sort''v photography there can be elements that dont totally work but its real life and not a setup which adds to its appeal ..  perfect number of frames IMO & that border is a master stroke .. i''d say it lifted your score quite a lot ...i had a look thru this challenge but didnt vote .. i had an image that caused a lot of controversy because the sc said i''d get a dq if i entered it .. they made assumptions about the image that were incorrect and even after further info they didnt retract their opinion .. i could have still entered it but didnt want to risk the dq .. its such a fine line as to wot will be accepted and wot wont with this new time lapse rule .. they said non-linear wasnt time lapse !! .. anyway i''m not saying anything negative about the sc .. they do the best job and a very difficult one i reckon in situations like my image .. anyway .. like i was saying !!!i had a look thru this challenge in voting and this one of yours just jumped right out at me !!! ... literally .. so congratulations on your new pb and a brilliant addition to your portfolio .. it looks just fantastic on your profile page .. :)', '2008-01-14 14:25:22.000000', NULL, 0),
