(4402408, 629757, 15291, '<td valign="top">Hello Enzo,<br/> <br/>First I would like to say congrats on the ribbon. I think you have a wonderful image here but I do have some issues. First that sign &amp; lightpole both cockeyed, I can live with the sign but the lightpole is murder. Secondly the first planes nose being abruptly cut off by your border some room was needed to have the feel of flight and direction. I get the feeling of run-up here the first plane stopped planes 2 &amp; 3 just kept coming.</td>', 'Hello Enzo, First I would like to say congrats on the ribbon. I think you have a wonderful image here but I do have some issues. First that sign & lightpole both cockeyed, I can live with the sign but the lightpole is murder. Secondly the first planes nose being abruptly cut off by your border some room was needed to have the feel of flight and direction. I get the feeling of run-up here the first plane stopped planes 2 & 3 just kept coming.', '2008-01-18 10:56:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(4402685, 629284, 72268, '<td valign="top">I really love this shot. This is magnificant. I love how it looks like he is popping out of the picture, and your right about the border, it really helped make the photo!! Nice work. Wish I could do something like this. Want to give me steps? ; )</td>', 'I really love this shot. This is magnificant. I love how it looks like he is popping out of the picture, and your right about the border, it really helped make the photo!! Nice work. Wish I could do something like this. Want to give me steps? ; )', '2008-01-18 13:28:56.000000', NULL, 0),
